WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.864
This query uses CTEs and a window function The
monthly sales

00:00:05.891 --> 00:00:10.827
stage has one row per month and product The ranked
stage keeps that grain and

00:00:10.854 --> 00:00:16.458
adds a rank within each month The final SELECT keeps
the top two rank

00:00:16.471 --> 00:00:22.214
groups This is a good example of readable staged SQL
that can transfer

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.254
to Spark SQL
